[gd_scene load_steps=19 format=3]

; zone_stonewood — the forest turned to stone (act 2, map one; A2-01, 2026-10-02), band 27–31.
;
; Past the Broken Gate the wood stands as it stood the day it stopped: trunks, leaves, deer and wolves,
; all grey stone, and crystal growing out of the ground between them. A road crosses it from the
; south-east corner to the north-west. Slate wolves hunt by the way in, shard spiders nest in the east,
; adders lie in the still grove; the golems keep a ring of crystal in the middle, the lichen caps a
; glade that is still green in the west, and the geodes a field of their own in the north. The Stone
; Stag holds a ring of crags in the south-west, one way in, behind its guard.
;
; Everything the player walks on or into is a kit piece naming an id; woods and clutter are
; ScatterNodes, seeded. Every creature is tuning in game/data/zones/act2.json. This file is
; coordinates. Written by `kiln scenes` from src/Kiln.Tools/Commands/Act2Layouts.cs: change the
; layout, not this file.

